# Build output. build.sh `cp`s these in from runtime/ on every build (they are
# re-staged after each re-clone), so they are generated, not source -- edit
# runtime/ instead. Without this they sit in `git status` forever and a
# `git add -A` commits them.
#
# Authored device-only modules (device_canvas.py, device_api.py, moy_runtime.py,
# moybyte_shell.py, ...) have no runtime/ twin and stay tracked.

